{\f0\fs17\b 3. What DebloatKit Does \emdash  Safety Statement}
\par
{\f0\fs17 All debloat operations use Android Debug Bridge (ADB) with the \f1\fs16 --user 0\f0\fs17  flag only. This means:}
\par
{\f0\fs17\li360\bullet  No system partition is modified}
\par
{\f0\fs17\li360\bullet  No APK files are permanently deleted}
\par
{\f0\fs17\li360\bullet  All changes are reversible via Re-enable or factory reset}
\par
{\f0\fs17\li360\bullet  No root access is required or used}
